    "replay_provenance": "Captured replay checks record the effective LEAN_PATH and four before/after object hashes. The exact environment equals the replay overlay prefix plus lake env LEAN_PATH; the capture script passes it to each subprocess. All source, log and object hashes and statuses were verified. Original baseline objects for two modules differ from replay objects, so the authenticated captured replay is the basis for comparison.",
    "graph": "All 36 recorded source hashes, object hashes and parsed direct local imports matched at review time; the graph had no missing local edges or cycles. None of those sources had newer timestamps than the pinned objects. ArithmeticCellLabels current source and its object matched its prior successful build receipt.",
    "warnings": "PackingCells replay and final logs retain the same exponentiation-threshold warning and existing simp/decide warnings at shifted source lines. ControllerData retains its existing unused section variable warning, and the CellDecoding client retains its existing warning.",
